ds\n- **File:** `server/templates/client.html:385-392`\n- `updateAutoBtn()` styles buttons green when active, muted when inactive\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:** No code changes are needed. The feature is fully implemented and working according to the plan.","time":{"start":1772833430699,"end":1772833430699}}}
